  "findings": [],
  "verified_behavior": [
    "Phase advancement follows validated planner output, own-branch finding validation and final native selection/export, instead of unvalidated caller phase skipping.",
    "Three investigators each start with task/question/policy only; no prior branch history or provisional findings. Global branch receipt ranges are captured by orchestration boundaries.",
    "Exact prepared prompt/profile/digest precedes reservation and capture persistence; received receipt/wire and response capture are checked before consuming model output.",
    "Model/source batch semantics reject mixed final/source submissions and unknown tool names; final join receives provisional findings plus public packet view and exports explicit selection.",
    "Synthetic provider/persistence/invalid-plan/window failures stop subsequent work and preserve known/unknown or pending-reservation evidence."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "prepare/dispatch is still a scripted-driver contract, not reviewed native measured-dispatch/recycler integration. Actual tokenizer usage and model efficiency are unmeasured.",
    "No context trimming/recycling policy is implemented here; oversized real histories fail. Native driver must integrate measured admission, provider health, secrets, durable ledgers, interruption and shared stop.",
    "execute_tool owns native argument validation/source safety. Source preparation, minimal-history baseline, common terminal policy, final persistence and full twelve-outcome supervision remain pending."
  ],
